WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.651
Percent means out of 100. Multiply the whole amount by the fraction represented by

00:00:05.651 --> 00:00:06.429
the percentage.

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:15.701
Find 20 percent of 40. The answer is 8. 20 percent equals 20/100, so 40 times 20/100

00:00:15.701 --> 00:00:16.691
equals 8.

00:00:17.533 --> 00:00:22.702
A group at a farm has 60 learners; 10 percent joined an activity. How many joined?

00:00:22.702 --> 00:00:24.317
Pause the video and think.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:31.947
A group at a farm has 60 learners; 10 percent joined an activity. How many joined?

00:00:31.947 --> 00:00:37.851
The answer is 6. 10 percent equals 10/100, so 60 times 10/100 equals 6.
